<div class="ml-[58.9vh] p-20 text-center max-w-full">
<h1>Making your trailer</h1>

<div class="bg-[#fb4bb0] rounded-xl p-5 mt-10">
    <h2>Contents</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="#Tracking">Tracking your time</a></li>
        <li><a href="#How">How do i make my trailer?</a></li>
        <li><a href="#What">What counts as a 'trailer'?</a></li>
    </ul>
    </div>

<div class="bg-[#fb4bb0] rounded-xl p-5 mt-10" id="Tracking">
    <h2>Tracking your time</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">You can track time spent on your trailer by either using <a href="https://lapse.hackclub.com/">Lapse</a> or by journaling - follow <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/18mAqzKjQgGmFW-BEkVi28VvouvtpxVlkRL8yUKbOg7U/edit?usp=sharing">this</a> template and make a copy. If you're planning on using Lapse, then you can sign in with Hack Club to record your timelapses and integrate them with your hackatime project.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-[#fb4bb0] rounded-xl p-5 mt-10" id="How">
        <h2>How do i make my trailer?</h2>
        <p>Take a look at this video below!</p>
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4CSYA9R70R8">
        <img src="/../../trailer_screenshot1.png">
        </a>
        </div>

<div class="bg-[#fb4bb0] rounded-xl p-5 mt-10" id="What">
<h2>What counts as a 'trailer'?</h2>
<p>Your trailer should be a video that markets your videogame. Think about including a hook, action clips (gameplay), the story, characters and a call to action.</p> 
</div>

<div class="bg-[#fb4bb0] rounded-xl p-5 mt-10">
<p>more coming soon</p>
</div>

</div>
